  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia: Regional Cooperation Arrangements (RCA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Regional Cooperation Arrangement (RCA) is a mechanism through which IOM supports the Government of Indonesia to assist refugees and asylum seekers in Indonesia with safe accomodation and basic asssitances, including health services, Mental Health and Psychosocial Support (MHPSS), formal and informal education, and assisted voluntary return and reintegration (AVRR).</narrative>
  </description>
